warning[require-concurrent-reindex]: reindexing a table or index without `concurrently` blocks reads and writes
  ╭▸ 
3 │ reindex index i;
  │ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ╰ help: use `concurrently` outside of a transaction to avoid blocking reads and writes
